WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Too many tabs. Where’s that page?

00:03.500 --> 00:11.000
Think of a name. Find it with Pinyin.
Type pinyin to match Chinese and English titles. Press Enter to open the result.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
One search, three sources: tabs, bookmarks, and history.
Use /t, /b, and /h to filter your search.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Your workflow, your way. Open /s to customize your theme, language, and search scope.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Let AI bring order to your tabs.
Type /ai and press Enter to organize the tabs in your current window.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
Less searching. More focus. Try Blazwitcher in Chrome.
